{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/extras/storePageImage.gif?t=1745159989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/extras/Story.png?t=1745159989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist finds themselves lost in a remote mountain village in Japan.<br>In this village, a mysterious legend tells of monsters that attack humans.<br>With the help of various companions, the protagonist must unravel the mysteries of the village, armed with a flashlight and a stun gun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/extras/storePageImage2.gif?t=1745159989\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/extras/FEATURES.png?t=1745159989\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use, equip, and combine randomly spawned items to progress through the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stealth action: sneak past monsters unnoticed or use your stun gun to strike when necessary.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dungeon exploration: solve diverse puzzles and utilize unique mechanics to overcome challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/extras/features2.gif?t=1745159989\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3427020?t=1745159989","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745159989","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427020/d2df3cce2e704239143cabe3523c6d4631e8711d/caps